WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:17.130
Jenny wasn't sure about letting us hypnotize her.

2
00:00:17.131 --> 00:00:21.481
"Don't worry, it will be fun!" said Josh.

3
00:00:21.482 --> 00:00:26.930
"All you have to do is sit and stare straight ahead," I added.

4
00:00:26.931 --> 00:00:29.872
At last Jenny said okay.

5
00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:33.486
"Maybe it will solve my school problems."

6
00:00:33.487 --> 00:00:38.883
"We need a necklace or something shiny to swing in front of you," I said.

7
00:00:38.884 --> 00:00:44.166
"I'll go get something from my jewelry box," said Molly.

8
00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:50.328
She ran upstairs to her apartment.

9
00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:52.838
A minute later she came back.

10
00:00:52.839 --> 00:00:57.124
She was holding a necklace with a big silver heart.

11
00:00:57.125 --> 00:01:00.198
"Perfect!" I said.

12
00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:04.475
"Now keep your eyes on this heart," I instructed Jenny.

13
00:01:04.476 --> 00:01:08.879
I swung the heart back and forth slowly in front of her.

14
00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.338
Jenny followed it with her eyes.

15
00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:16.742
"You're getting sleepy," I said in a soft voice.

16
00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:23.308
"Very, very sleepy."

17
00:01:23.309 --> 00:01:27.656
"Is she hypnotized yet?" asked Molly.

18
00:01:27.657 --> 00:01:32.781
I snapped my fingers in front of Jenny's face. She blinked.

19
00:01:32.782 --> 00:01:37.705
"Not quite," I said. I swung the heart again.

20
00:01:37.706 --> 00:01:41.075
Jenny just sat there, staring.

21
00:01:41.076 --> 00:01:46.572
"I think she's hypnotized now," whispered Josh.

22
00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:50.744
"Jenny!" I said in a loud, commanding voice.

23
00:01:50.745 --> 00:01:54.689
"Tell us why you are having trouble in school!"

24
00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:59.293
Jenny blinked. "Iggy, why are you yelling at me?"

25
00:01:59.294 --> 00:02:03.058
"Jenny, you're not supposed to blink," I said.

26
00:02:03.059 --> 00:02:05.814
"That ruins the spell."

27
00:02:05.815 --> 00:02:07.852
Jenny rubbed her eyes.

28
00:02:07.853 --> 00:02:09.743
"I can't help it.

29
00:02:09.744 --> 00:02:13.592
That swinging heart made my eyes all blurry."

30
00:02:13.593 --> 00:02:16.732
"I'm afraid the trance is broken," I said.

31
00:02:16.733 --> 00:02:18.810
Jenny looked disappointed.

32
00:02:18.811 --> 00:02:21.951
"I was hoping this would work."

33
00:02:21.952 --> 00:02:25.042
"Me too," I said.

34
00:02:25.043 --> 00:02:28.291
"Jenny!" called Mr. Chen.

35
00:02:28.292 --> 00:02:32.010
"It's time to study for your math test."

36
00:02:32.011 --> 00:02:34.748
"Good luck," I said to Jenny.

37
00:02:34.749 --> 00:02:39.975
I felt bad that I had not been able to help her.

38
00:02:39.976 --> 00:02:45.705
The next day at recess, Molly and Jenny wanted to go on the slide.

39
00:02:45.706 --> 00:02:48.046
But I wasn't in the mood.

40
00:02:48.047 --> 00:02:51.320
All the kids in line were yelling and pushing.

41
00:02:51.321 --> 00:02:55.938
"Hey, stop shoving!" yelled a girl to Evan.

42
00:02:55.939 --> 00:02:57.402
"I didn't shove.

43
00:02:57.403 --> 00:03:02.679
It was the kid behind me," said Evan.

44
00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:06.237
Soon Mr. Dalmati blew his whistle.

45
00:03:06.238 --> 00:03:07.732
"Recess is over.

46
00:03:07.733 --> 00:03:12.355
Everyone line up to go inside quietly."

47
00:03:12.356 --> 00:03:17.786
"I dropped my new hair clip," said Jenny, looking around.

48
00:03:17.787 --> 00:03:21.002
"And now I can't find it."

49
00:03:21.003 --> 00:03:25.419
"Here it is," said Molly, leaning over to pick it up.

50
00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:28.124
"It was right under your nose."

51
00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:32.069
"Right under your nose," I thought.

52
00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:36.509
The famous inventor, Mr. Bright, was coming to our school soon.

53
00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:42.288
I had a feeling there was an invention idea right under my nose.

54
00:03:42.289 --> 00:03:49.086
But I couldn't think of what it was.

55
00:03:49.087 --> 00:03:55.518
Walking home after school that day, we passed a new shop, Mom's Bakery.

56
00:03:55.519 --> 00:03:57.820
Actually, we smelled it first.

57
00:03:57.821 --> 00:04:01.724
And did it smell good!

58
00:04:01.725 --> 00:04:06.646
Jenny, Josh, Molly, and I stopped and looked in the window.

59
00:04:06.647 --> 00:04:11.655
It was filled with chocolate brownies, cookies, and frosted cupcakes.

60
00:04:11.656 --> 00:04:16.422
"I wish that was my mom's bakeshop!" I said.

61
00:04:16.423 --> 00:04:20.810
"I'm starving," said Josh.

62
00:04:20.811 --> 00:04:25.426
"My mouth is watering," said Molly.

63
00:04:25.427 --> 00:04:30.975
"But I don't have any money with me."

64
00:04:30.976 --> 00:04:34.180
We went into the crowded bakeshop.

65
00:04:34.181 --> 00:04:39.734
"Number seven is next!" called a man from behind the counter.

66
00:04:39.735 --> 00:04:42.592
A woman stepped up to the counter.

67
00:04:42.593 --> 00:04:44.509
"I have number seven."

68
00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.995
She handed the man a ticket.

69
00:04:46.996 --> 00:04:50.842
"I'd like a chocolate chip cookie, please."

70
00:04:50.843 --> 00:04:55.022
The man took the woman's ticket and gave her a cookie.

71
00:04:55.023 --> 00:04:58.650
"Number eight!" he called out next.

72
00:04:58.651 --> 00:05:03.882
I noticed that everyone was holding a numbered ticket.

73
00:05:03.883 --> 00:05:06.663
That's when the idea came to me.

74
00:05:06.664 --> 00:05:09.488
"I've got it!" I cried.

75
00:05:09.489 --> 00:05:12.356
"Got what?" asked Molly.

76
00:05:12.357 --> 00:05:16.218
"An idea for a new invention!" I said.

77
00:05:16.219 --> 00:05:19.422
"And you know what the amazing thing is?"

78
00:05:19.423 --> 00:05:22.511
"What?" said Josh.

79
00:05:22.512 --> 00:05:33.066
I grinned. "The idea was right under my nose!"
